{"nodes": [{"id": "skill_fable_architect_ruleset", "label": "Fable-Style Architecture & Planning (ruleset)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-architect/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Discover before designing, decide load-bearing first, delegate cheap work, verify against ground truth, leave a written decision trail."}, {"id": "skill_fable_architect_rule1_refuse_easy_work", "label": "Rule 1: Refuse to spend the window on easy work", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-architect/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Classify tasks by cost-to-reverse/subsystem span/subtlety/precedent; push mechanical work to cheaper models, keep only decomposition/tradeoffs/verification on the expensive model."}, {"id": "skill_fable_architect_rule2_one_big_brief", "label": "Rule 2: One big brief; ask only what the repo cannot answer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-architect/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Assemble full context first, then ask at most five questions only for facts no artifact can supply."}, {"id": "skill_fable_architect_rule3_load_bearing_first", "label": "Rule 3: Plan load-bearing decisions first, features second", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-architect/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Order planning by cost-to-reverse: invariants and data contracts first, execution/ownership model second, features last; write irreversible decisions as ADRs with a named revisit trigger."}, {"id": "skill_fable_architect_rule4_options_with_tradeoffs", "label": "Rule 4: High effort means options with trade-offs, not longer prose", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-architect/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "At every genuine fork generate 2-3 options, state the trade-off, pick one, record why losers lost."}, {"id": "skill_fable_architect_rule5_one_project_brain", "label": "Rule 5: Maintain one project brain, and keep it verified", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-architect/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Keep a single CLAUDE.md as the brain backed by docs/adr/; update only with facts the code cannot say itself."}, {"id": "skill_fable_architect_rule6_verify_before_reporting", "label": "Rule 6: Verify before reporting: try to break your own output", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-architect/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three passes before calling anything done: ground truth check against the repo, adversarial 'what breaks this', and root-cause proof for bug fixes."}, {"id": "skill_fable_architect_rule7_gate_on_results", "label": "Rule 7: Gate on results: every phase ends with a branch decision", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-architect/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "After each result explicitly choose proceed/refine/escalate; define the gate before delegated work starts."}, {"id": "skill_fable_architect_rule8_over_specified_prompts_advisory", "label": "Rule 8: Treat over-specified prompts and ambient noise as advisory", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-architect/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Extract intent from rigid templates/false-positive hooks and adapt to what discovery found, noting the conflict in one line."}, {"id": "skill_fable_architect_rule9_failure_path_holds_everything", "label": "Rule 9: The failure path still holds everything the attempt acquired", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-architect/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Recovery code runs inside the wreckage of the failing attempt; release locks/rollback before opening a second transaction to record failure, else a silent lock-wait hang results."}], "edges": [{"source": "skill_fable_architect_rule1_refuse_easy_work", "target": "skill_fable_architect_ruleset", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-architect/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "skill_fable_architect_rule2_one_big_brief", "target": "skill_fable_architect_ruleset", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-architect/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "skill_fable_architect_rule3_load_bearing_first", "target": "skill_fable_architect_ruleset", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-architect/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "skill_fable_architect_rule4_options_with_tradeoffs", "target": "skill_fable_architect_ruleset", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/fable-architect/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "skill_fable_architect_rule5_one_project_brain", "target": "skill_fable_architect_ruleset", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRAC